#: app.cpp:187
msgid ""
"You selected to remove a program. Following applications are part of the same "
"package, and they will be removed. Are you sure you want to remove? "
msgstr ""
"Indicou que quer eliminar un programa. As seguintes aplicazóns forman parte do "
"mesmo pacote, e serán eliminadas con el. Está seguro de que desexa eliminar? "

#: app.cpp:193
msgid "Confirm action"
msgstr "Confirmar Aczón"

#: app.cpp:259
msgid "Review Changes"
msgstr "Revisar Modificazóns"

#: app.cpp:277 app.cpp:387
msgid "Back to Program Selection"
msgstr "Voltar á Seleczón de Programas"

#: app.cpp:287
msgid "Changes are OK, proceed"
msgstr "Cámbios correctos, proceder"

#: app.cpp:319
msgid "Apply Changes"
msgstr "Aplicar Cámbios"

#: app.cpp:321
msgid "Inspect Changes"
msgstr "Examinar Cámbios"

#: app.cpp:349
msgid "Forget Changes and Quit"
msgstr "Esquecer cámbios e Sair"

#: app.cpp:373
msgid ""
"There was an error commiting changes. Possibly there was a problem downloading "
"some packages or the commit would break packages. "
msgstr ""
"Aconteceu un erro ao enviar os cámbios. Posibelmente fose ou un problema ao "
"descarregar algun pacote ou que a tarefa estragaria dependéncias. "

#: app.cpp:376
msgid "Could not commit changes"
msgstr "Non foi posíbel realizar os cámbios"

